[ti:Mirage In Retrospect]
[ar:星尘Infinity]
[al:与你相连的雪之羁绊]
[by:RQvan]
[00:00.00]Mirage In Retrospect
[00:03.00]
[00:06.00]作曲/编曲/混音：雪人Snowman
[00:08.00]作词：小皮
[00:10.00]调校：某只泽
[00:12.00]曲绘：不鱼
[00:14.00]视频：青色QING
[00:16.00]Saxophone：Manuel Trabucco
[00:18.00]演唱：星尘Infinity
[00:20.00]
[00:25.38]Reflection of light,
[00:28.00]Reflection of you in my mind.
[00:30.84]Missing a fraction
[00:33.50]A Silent distraction
[00:35.60]Piecing all the fragments to find,
[00:38.82]Traces of all things intertwined, rewind.
[00:43.77]Would you rewrite the pages of regrets?

[00:25.38]光的倒影、
[00:28.00]你在我心中的倒影
[00:30.84]错过一小部分
[00:33.50]无声的分心
[00:35.60]拼凑所有碎片寻找、
[00:38.82]万物交织的痕迹，倒带。
[00:43.77]你会重写那一页页遗憾吗？

[00:50.77]As true as it seems,
[00:53.41]Do you believe
[00:55.82]In the author within?
[00:58.48]Pen on your script,
[01:01.56]Taking the lead
[01:03.82]Next scene, next theme?
[01:09.01]
[01:12.86]Would you ever cross the line,
[01:15.56]Turning to a page once left behind?
[01:18.35]A story of mirage in retrospect
[01:23.60]Whispers of what used to be,
[01:26.39]Echoes of a distant make-believe,
[01:29.28]Cascading down the stream, way too deep.
[01:35.80]
[02:31.37]Glimpse of an eye,
[02:34.68]Glimpse of the past from your sight
[02:37.25]Breaking the sirens
[02:39.67]Mending our silence
[02:42.11]Piecing all the fragments to find,
[02:45.02]Traces of all things intertwined, rewind.
[02:50.15]Would you rewrite the pages of regrets?

[00:50.77]看似真实、
[00:53.41]你相信
[00:55.82]内心的作者？
[00:58.48]用笔写下你的剧本、
[01:01.56]引领
[01:03.82]下一个场景，下一个主题？

[01:12.86]你是否会越过界限
[01:15.56]翻开曾经遗落的一页？
[01:18.35]回顾海市蜃楼的故事
[01:23.60]曾经的低语
[01:26.39]遥远虚幻的回声、
[01:29.28]流水潺潺，深不见底。

[02:31.37]惊鸿一瞥
[02:34.68]从你的视线中瞥见过去
[02:37.25]打破警报
[02:39.67]修补我们的沉默
[02:42.11]拼凑所有碎片，寻找、
[02:45.02]万物交织的痕迹，倒带。
